<title>UK: EU 1996/97 sugar awards total 1.25 mln tonnes.</title>
<headline>EU 1996/97 sugar awards total 1.25 mln tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union (EU) has awarded a cumulative 1.25 million tonnes of sugar in its tender series for export licences from the 1996/97 crop after this week's award of 40,500 tonnes on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The EU awarded 7,250 tonnes of sugar in its tender on December 20, 1995, the equivalent week of the previous series, when the cumulative total was 1.36 million tonnes.</p>
<p>-- Jeremy Smith, London Newsroom +44 171 542 8064</p>
</text>
